WEBVTT

00:07.902 --> 00:13.662
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.162 --> 00:19.752
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.752 --> 00:19.792
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.792 --> 00:28.342
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.342 --> 00:30.212
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.592 --> 00:34.142
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.472 --> 00:37.972
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.472 --> 00:40.812
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.812 --> 00:45.562
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.692 --> 00:48.902
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.862 --> 00:51.862
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.412 --> 01:01.122
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.452 --> 01:03.462
...with you.
futaride

01:04.462 --> 01:10.172
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.842 --> 01:16.262
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.472 --> 01:24.772
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.772 --> 01:26.602
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:30.052 --> 01:34.142
Futabadai Second Junior High School

01:37.642 --> 01:38.932
Super Sale

01:38.932 --> 01:40.892
Hey, Kurosake-san,
Super Sale

01:40.892 --> 01:41.392
Super Sale

01:41.392 --> 01:45.022
are you shopping at the Super Sale store again?

01:45.022 --> 01:51.192
If you swear allegiance to me, I can let you shop at a richer store.

01:52.322 --> 01:53.952
Oh, I'm not.

01:53.952 --> 01:55.202
It's our balance book.

01:55.202 --> 01:57.202
Balance for the Month
Food: -51
Rent: Delayed
Electric: -20
Misc.: -170
Tansp.:
It's our balance book.

01:57.532 --> 01:59.202
Balance book?

01:59.202 --> 02:02.212
Wow, you're so good.

02:03.252 --> 02:06.172
Not... really.

02:06.172 --> 02:08.212
What's wrong?

02:08.212 --> 02:10.132
We're in the red again.

02:10.132 --> 02:15.802
We need to ask the boss to get us more work.

02:16.682 --> 02:18.102
Kurosake-san...

02:18.102 --> 02:19.682
Sounds tough...

02:19.682 --> 02:22.562
Then I'll help you.

02:22.562 --> 02:27.942
Well, if you swear allegiance to me, I won't mind helping you for a bit.

02:28.072 --> 02:29.652
Thank you!

02:29.652 --> 02:31.282
But it's okay.

02:31.442 --> 02:34.322
Mom is working hard at home right now.

02:34.322 --> 02:36.372
It will work out!

02:52.302 --> 02:56.842
Naga Posi

02:56.932 --> 02:58.722
I'm home.

03:03.482 --> 03:05.392
I'm sleepy.

03:07.232 --> 03:09.772
I somehow survived today,

03:10.482 --> 03:13.492
but there's another assignment to be submitted tomorrow.

03:14.992 --> 03:16.282
Hello.

03:17.782 --> 03:22.242
No, I swear that I will work on it after I take a short nap.

03:22.702 --> 03:25.372
Or else, I won't last...

03:29.632 --> 03:30.922
This is...

03:42.972 --> 03:44.222
Sayoko-san!

03:50.982 --> 03:53.232
So, what's all the commotion?

03:53.232 --> 03:55.282
Well, Sayoko-san is...

03:56.742 --> 03:59.452
Oh, Sayo-chan did it again?

04:00.072 --> 04:03.202
It happens all the time, so just leave her alone.

04:06.372 --> 04:07.912
You might not be able to finish it, right?

04:09.252 --> 04:10.172
Nod.

04:11.252 --> 04:13.172
You might not be able to finish it?

04:13.172 --> 04:15.552
But you don't have to hide...

04:15.552 --> 04:18.012
Hey, Shiratori,

04:18.432 --> 04:21.972
there's a boss who gives them the work,

04:21.972 --> 04:25.812
but according to Asami, he's very strict about the work.

04:27.982 --> 04:30.312
Then you really have to work harder...

04:33.022 --> 04:34.272
Sayoko-san!?

04:35.192 --> 04:36.362
Sayoko-san, you can't do that.
I'm home!

04:36.362 --> 04:37.192
Sayoko-san, you can't do that.

04:37.192 --> 04:39.612
Sayoko-san!

04:39.612 --> 04:41.242
No...

04:41.702 --> 04:44.282
Please come out.

04:44.282 --> 04:47.082
Mom, what are you doing there?

04:50.622 --> 04:51.752
What about the work?

04:51.752 --> 04:54.712
2,500 left.

04:55.342 --> 04:57.712
You haven't done much at all!

04:57.712 --> 04:59.932
What were you doing all day?

04:59.932 --> 05:01.132
Work.

05:01.132 --> 05:02.802
I know that.

05:02.802 --> 05:03.852
What are we going to do?

05:03.852 --> 05:06.312
The boss will be mad at us.

05:06.312 --> 05:07.642
Drag, drag...

05:07.642 --> 05:10.442
Here, Asami, come here.

05:10.442 --> 05:12.562
You don't have to hide.

05:12.852 --> 05:16.152
I'm sure we can finish it if we work together!

05:16.572 --> 05:18.572
Well, well, you two,

05:18.572 --> 05:20.902
there's nothing to worry about.

05:21.952 --> 05:27.162
Here's a kind man who can't ignore people in trouble.

05:38.462 --> 05:40.342
Why am I here?

05:40.922 --> 05:46.762
Besides, this room is completely filled with cardboard boxes...

05:46.762 --> 05:47.602
Onii-chan.

05:48.522 --> 05:49.602
Thank you.

05:49.602 --> 05:51.602
This really helps us out.

05:53.152 --> 05:54.652
Um, Asami-chan?

05:54.862 --> 05:58.442
Are all these boxes...

05:58.442 --> 06:01.112
Yeah. Those are imitation flowers, and these are for paper bag making.

06:01.112 --> 06:04.112
And those piles are for the mail that needs addressed.

06:05.872 --> 06:07.912
We also have keychains to be colored!

06:09.542 --> 06:13.542
Asami-chan, isn't it inconvenient to have your furniture behind all the boxes?

06:13.542 --> 06:15.042
We don't have furniture,

06:15.712 --> 06:17.842
because we are poor.

06:18.052 --> 06:20.672
You say it so happily...

06:20.672 --> 06:23.092
It's okay without furniture!

06:23.432 --> 06:25.552
As long as we have the cardboard boxes...

06:25.552 --> 06:27.142
They can be futons,

06:27.142 --> 06:28.512
or desks,

06:28.512 --> 06:30.352
or even dressers!

06:30.642 --> 06:33.482
They are warm, light and sturdy.

06:33.482 --> 06:36.692
Cardboard boxes are really useful.

06:36.692 --> 06:38.272
I see.

06:39.402 --> 06:41.192
Can they finish?

06:41.652 --> 06:43.532
It'll be bad if they can't.

06:43.532 --> 06:47.912
Well, he actually seems gutsy, so it'll be fine.

06:47.912 --> 06:50.662
Yeah, unlike someone else.

06:50.662 --> 06:51.372
What!?

06:51.872 --> 06:55.002
You're not talking to me, but to him, right?

06:55.002 --> 06:56.382
Right, right?

06:56.382 --> 06:57.382
Right?

06:57.382 --> 06:58.672
We're home.
Right?

06:58.672 --> 06:59.422
We're home.

06:59.632 --> 07:02.422
Welcome home, Kozue-chan, Tama-chan.

07:02.422 --> 07:05.302
Are you planning a party?

07:05.432 --> 07:06.802
Hey, hey,

07:06.802 --> 07:10.062
we can't have parties every single day.

07:10.062 --> 07:14.272
Momono-san, isn't Shiratori-san with you today?

07:14.272 --> 07:17.482
Oh, Shiratori-kun is in there.

07:18.022 --> 07:20.482
In Sayoko-san's room?

07:20.482 --> 07:24.322
Aha, could it be that?

07:24.322 --> 07:25.952
Could it be?

07:26.112 --> 07:30.952
Well, let's forget about them and do our homework in my room.

07:31.492 --> 07:34.252
That's some yummy looking orange juice.

07:35.752 --> 07:37.422
Don't touch that.

07:37.422 --> 07:40.712
I'm drinking that later with Kozue-chan.

07:40.712 --> 07:41.632
Ouch!

07:41.632 --> 07:41.962
That hurts!

07:41.962 --> 07:43.172
Do you understand?
That hurts!

07:43.172 --> 07:43.962
Yes, I do!
Do you understand?

07:43.962 --> 07:44.462
Yes, I do!

07:45.552 --> 07:47.342
Ouch! Stop!

07:47.342 --> 07:48.342
I'm sorry.

08:02.942 --> 08:06.572
Why am I doing this?

08:06.742 --> 08:10.992
By the way, I haven't seen Asami-chan's father.

08:10.992 --> 08:14.582
Does she not have one because of divorce or death?

08:16.872 --> 08:21.132
That may explain this extreme poverty.

08:21.712 --> 08:23.002
Above all,

08:23.552 --> 08:26.302
the mother, who needs to be earning money,

08:28.382 --> 08:30.392
is like that...

08:31.472 --> 08:33.432
Mom, it's okay.

08:33.432 --> 08:35.472
You just need to do it like this.

08:37.732 --> 08:39.772
I'll show you, so watch carefully.

08:39.772 --> 08:42.772
A negative mother who gives up quickly,

08:42.772 --> 08:46.532
and a positive daughter who is always happy and never gives up in any situation.

08:46.532 --> 08:49.112
They're polar opposites.

08:49.112 --> 08:51.952
Let's keep going at this pace!

08:51.952 --> 08:52.622
Yeah.

08:56.042 --> 08:58.252
Let's have dinner.

08:58.582 --> 08:59.832
It's that time already?

09:02.832 --> 09:05.212
We'd better eat properly.

09:05.212 --> 09:07.342
It might get tough tonight.

09:08.302 --> 09:10.092
Tough?

09:10.092 --> 09:12.932
I'll go shopping now.

09:13.802 --> 09:15.642
Can I come too?

09:15.642 --> 09:17.142
It would be a lot of work if you went by yourself.

09:17.142 --> 09:17.932
Yeah!

09:21.022 --> 09:23.522
Futaba Supermarket

09:28.942 --> 09:30.742
It's pretty crowded.

09:30.742 --> 09:33.952
It gets worse when there's a time-limited sale.

09:36.742 --> 09:40.212
The milk in the back is fresher.

09:41.292 --> 09:42.462
You know a lot.

09:46.752 --> 09:49.052
Onee-san, can I have one of those?

09:49.052 --> 09:51.052
Sure, and as a thanks for all your patronage,

09:51.052 --> 09:52.682
these are on me.

09:52.932 --> 09:54.392
Here you go.

09:55.682 --> 09:56.812
That was good.

09:56.812 --> 09:58.642
Yeah! Thank you, Onee-san!

10:04.772 --> 10:07.482
Asami-chan, you're good at shopping.

10:07.482 --> 10:09.482
Not really.

10:11.282 --> 10:12.402
What is it?

10:12.402 --> 10:13.952
That's the Half-Price Man!

10:13.952 --> 10:15.322
The Half-Price Man!

10:15.322 --> 10:16.912
The Half-Price Man?

10:20.752 --> 10:25.292
We're commencing the Time-Limited Sale of Futaba Supermarket!

10:25.582 --> 10:29.422
All items in these carts are all half priced!

10:29.422 --> 10:30.302
All half price!

10:30.302 --> 10:32.132
This is your chance!

10:36.142 --> 10:38.062
I'll be back in a bit.

10:38.392 --> 10:40.472
Oka...y...

10:48.982 --> 10:50.192
Asami-chan!

10:51.282 --> 10:53.032
Are you okay, Asami-chan?

10:55.362 --> 10:57.822
Shiratori Onii-chan!

10:57.992 --> 11:00.582
Asami-chan!

11:01.082 --> 11:03.122
Year 200X,

11:03.122 --> 11:10.882
Asami-chan and I were tossed about in the waves of housewife power!

11:14.632 --> 11:16.392
Zzzz...

11:18.012 --> 11:19.852
Zzzz...

11:21.142 --> 11:23.142
Zzzz...

11:33.062 --> 11:33.852
Futaba Supermarket

11:33.852 --> 11:35.562
Thank you, Onii-chan.
Futaba Supermarket

11:36.442 --> 11:39.072
I wasn't stepped on as much as usual.

11:39.862 --> 11:42.442
That means it's usually worse!?

11:42.742 --> 11:45.702
Now that we have food for a week,

11:45.702 --> 11:47.822
we need to go home and fix some dinner.

11:47.822 --> 11:50.742
I'm sure Mom is hungry and crying.

11:55.922 --> 11:57.672
Can you stay for dinner?

11:57.672 --> 11:59.712
I want you to.

11:59.712 --> 12:00.422
OK?

12:05.972 --> 12:07.342
Seriously?

12:08.302 --> 12:09.432
Dinner?

12:10.312 --> 12:11.722
Not yet.

12:13.232 --> 12:14.182
Sure.

12:16.602 --> 12:19.022
So, where are we eating?

12:21.862 --> 12:23.282
True.

12:23.282 --> 12:26.662
I'm sure she wants to play, too.

12:28.162 --> 12:31.832
Come on, you're working hard now, so...

12:31.832 --> 12:33.252
She was drinking it straight...

12:34.122 --> 12:35.082
Straight?

12:35.502 --> 12:38.712
She drank the orange juice without diluting it.

12:39.842 --> 12:43.712
You really should dilute it with twice as much water.

12:44.172 --> 12:46.222
Twice?

12:48.802 --> 12:50.642
It's ready, Asami.

12:50.642 --> 12:52.182
Yay!

12:55.642 --> 12:58.902
Orange juice really needs to be diluted.

12:58.902 --> 12:59.062
3x as Much Orange Juice
Orange juice really needs to be diluted.

12:59.062 --> 13:01.112
3x as Much Orange Juice

13:06.452 --> 13:08.282
This is a shortcut.

13:12.952 --> 13:14.702
Look, Onii-chan!

13:14.702 --> 13:17.582
There is so much grass here!

13:17.582 --> 13:21.592
Oh, she has her childlike side too.

13:23.382 --> 13:24.762
Yay!

13:24.762 --> 13:27.972
This kind of grass is called Nohiru, and it's edible.

13:28.632 --> 13:30.012
Asami-chan!?

13:30.182 --> 13:33.722
We're super lucky to find this here!

13:33.722 --> 13:36.732
I need to thank Kozue Onee-chan later.

13:36.932 --> 13:39.232
That book came in handy.

13:39.232 --> 13:40.232
That book?

13:45.232 --> 13:48.202
Survival Cooking

13:48.202 --> 13:48.702
Oh, that.
Survival Cooking

13:48.702 --> 13:49.612
Oh, that.

13:50.572 --> 13:52.572
We're home.

13:53.332 --> 13:55.242
Mom, we're home.

13:56.122 --> 13:57.662
Mom!

14:09.422 --> 14:11.972
Oh, welcome home.

14:11.972 --> 14:14.552
You were just sleeping, right?

14:16.722 --> 14:18.062
Here you go!

14:21.352 --> 14:23.022
Eat before it gets cold!

14:25.192 --> 14:27.442
It looks good.

14:27.442 --> 14:30.112
But those sautÃ©ed greens are...

14:31.202 --> 14:34.122
No doubt about it, it's that grass.

14:35.952 --> 14:37.492
She's watching me.

14:38.502 --> 14:40.832
She's really watching me!

14:42.252 --> 14:43.792
What should I do?

14:46.752 --> 14:48.512
It shouldn't kill me!

14:56.512 --> 14:57.602
It's delicious!

14:57.852 --> 14:58.932
Really?

14:59.432 --> 15:00.732
It's really good.

15:00.932 --> 15:02.192
Good!

15:02.192 --> 15:04.232
I'm happy to hear that!

15:04.652 --> 15:07.772
Moments like this make cooking fun.

15:07.772 --> 15:08.782
Really?

15:09.822 --> 15:12.282
It makes me feel good that I worked hard.

15:13.742 --> 15:15.452
This is nice.

15:15.452 --> 15:18.202
Having such a sister would be really nice.

15:19.702 --> 15:20.412
Mom!

15:20.412 --> 15:21.912
Who's the parent and who's the kid?
Mom!

15:21.912 --> 15:23.212
Who's the parent and who's the kid?

15:23.212 --> 15:23.712
Don't!
Who's the parent and who's the kid?

15:23.712 --> 15:24.672
Don't!

15:24.922 --> 15:26.172
Parent and child!?

15:26.172 --> 15:27.422
Parent and Child

15:27.422 --> 15:29.172
Okay, everyone,
Parent and Child

15:29.172 --> 15:31.672
here is another assignment.
Parent and Child

15:31.672 --> 15:31.722
here is another assignment.

15:31.722 --> 15:38.972
I'd like you to draw Mar, Mar, Marchen pictures of parents and children.

15:38.972 --> 15:40.272
Parents and children...

15:40.272 --> 15:42.272
It's due tomorrow.

15:42.272 --> 15:45.272
Be sure not to forget it.

15:46.192 --> 15:48.022
Drats!

15:48.022 --> 15:50.032
I completely forgot!

15:50.362 --> 15:53.572
This pair won't be a good model.

15:54.662 --> 15:56.112
Well, then.

15:57.282 --> 16:00.742
Now that we're full, let's get started.

16:00.742 --> 16:03.832
All right, let's get this done quickly, with energy!

16:04.462 --> 16:07.332
Or else, my time for the assignment...

16:07.632 --> 16:11.132
You can just help us for a short while.

16:11.802 --> 16:14.682
There are a lot, so they won't get done so easily.

16:14.682 --> 16:16.682
I'm happy just with your willingness.

16:18.352 --> 16:19.932
I'll help you until it's finished.

16:20.472 --> 16:21.642
But...

16:21.642 --> 16:24.852
It's to thank you for the delicious dinner.

16:26.022 --> 16:26.852
OK!

16:27.442 --> 16:29.652
Work is Hard, Part 1

16:29.652 --> 16:31.532
Quickly, quickly.

16:31.532 --> 16:33.532
Hmm, hmm.

16:40.452 --> 16:42.662
Work is Hard, Part 2

16:50.962 --> 16:53.172
Work is Hard, Part 3

17:04.222 --> 17:06.692
Jeez, Mom!

17:31.542 --> 17:33.962
We only have this box left.

17:33.962 --> 17:35.672
The end is in sight.

17:35.672 --> 17:37.012
Let's do it, Asami-chan.

17:37.012 --> 17:37.592
Yeah!

17:39.722 --> 17:41.602
Mom...

17:41.602 --> 17:42.392
Asami.

17:44.722 --> 17:46.892
Thank you, Mom.

17:47.142 --> 17:50.482
So Sayoko-san really is the mother.

17:50.482 --> 17:53.072
Asami-chan is her precious child.

17:53.072 --> 17:55.282
They're a good family.

17:55.282 --> 17:57.942
I might be able to finish the assignment.

17:57.942 --> 17:59.242
Yum!

18:04.702 --> 18:06.042
Kozue-chan!

18:06.042 --> 18:07.452
Good evening.

18:07.452 --> 18:08.662
Tamami-chan.

18:08.662 --> 18:11.082
You're making rice balls?

18:12.502 --> 18:14.042
There are so many.

18:14.042 --> 18:15.752
Who are they for?

18:18.592 --> 18:20.182
Oh, I know,

18:20.182 --> 18:22.342
it's been a tough night.

18:22.342 --> 18:25.012
Kozue-chan, would you like some juice?

18:25.472 --> 18:27.522
We have some orange juice that we bought today.

18:30.642 --> 18:31.812
What's wrong?

18:32.692 --> 18:34.942
What is this!?

18:34.942 --> 18:35.902
Oh my.

18:39.782 --> 18:41.782
It's yummy!

18:43.372 --> 18:45.122
Have some, Onii-chan.

18:45.492 --> 18:46.912
I'm okay.

18:46.912 --> 18:48.372
Don't be shy.

18:48.372 --> 18:50.372
It's really good!

18:50.372 --> 18:51.582
Really?

18:51.582 --> 18:53.422
Then just a little.

18:56.502 --> 19:01.302
Who is the one who drank my orange juice?

19:02.262 --> 19:03.642
Could it be...

19:05.222 --> 19:09.022
I see, so it's you, Shiratori-san.

19:09.932 --> 19:11.182
This?

19:11.182 --> 19:13.352
No, this is...

19:13.352 --> 19:16.362
You've got guts.

19:16.982 --> 19:20.032
You know what,

19:20.032 --> 19:21.612
Shiratori-san...

19:22.952 --> 19:25.122
Well, this is...

19:29.622 --> 19:32.002
I brought some snacks,

19:32.002 --> 19:34.422
so eat some if you'd like.

19:34.422 --> 19:36.842
They're made with umeboshi to energize you.

19:37.712 --> 19:39.052
Miss Landlady!

20:03.242 --> 20:04.862
All done!

20:05.162 --> 20:08.582
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

20:08.742 --> 20:09.832
It's morning!

20:09.832 --> 20:11.832
So bright!

20:11.832 --> 20:13.712
Yay!

20:16.172 --> 20:17.882
I'm so tired.

20:17.882 --> 20:19.842
Onii-chan, thank you!

20:19.842 --> 20:23.342
It really, really helped us.

20:23.552 --> 20:27.512
There's some time before the boss comes to pick them up, so it's perfect!

20:27.892 --> 20:30.352
I'm happy that I could help you out.

20:32.772 --> 20:34.562
It helped me out, too.

20:34.562 --> 20:36.812
It gave me an idea for the assignment.

20:37.352 --> 20:38.272
All right.

20:38.272 --> 20:40.732
I need to go back to my room and work hard.

20:52.372 --> 20:55.122
Um, Sayoko-san...?

20:57.712 --> 20:59.252
Hooray!

20:59.252 --> 21:00.342
Hooray...

21:01.092 --> 21:04.092
So many unmade flowers...

21:04.882 --> 21:06.632
Mom?

21:06.632 --> 21:08.842
