21:09.762 --> 21:10.932
They are real.

21:15.432 --> 21:17.272
Kojima Flowers

21:17.272 --> 21:18.312
Thanks!
Kojima Flowers

21:18.312 --> 21:19.732
I'll come again!
Kojima Flowers

21:19.732 --> 21:21.942
Kojima Flowers

21:28.912 --> 21:30.822
Shiratori Ryushi-kun,

21:31.412 --> 21:35.202
you didn't forget your assignment,

21:35.202 --> 21:38.172
The cardboard box family lived happily ever after.
but this is not the place to sleep.

21:38.172 --> 21:42.032
The cardboard box family lived happily ever after.

21:49.402 --> 21:55.912
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

21:55.992 --> 22:01.712
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:03.132 --> 22:09.592
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:09.842 --> 22:14.892
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:16.852 --> 22:23.602
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:23.852 --> 22:29.532
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:30.532 --> 22:36.372
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:36.372 --> 22:38.622
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:38.832 --> 22:45.002
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:45.502 --> 22:51.342
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:51.342 --> 22:55.972
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

